1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,242
Citrate is rearranged to isocitrate.

2
00:00:03,242 --> 00:00:10,963
Isocitrate loses a carbon dioxide and makes NADH, leaving alpha-ketoglutarate, five carbons.

3
00:00:10,963 --> 00:00:18,841
That loses a second carbon dioxide and makes another NADH: succinyl coenzyme A, four carbons.

